{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"xpath\" initial=\"a\">\n  <datamodel>\n    <data id=\"a1\" expr=\"5\"/>\n    <data id=\"count\" expr=\"0\"/>\n    <data id=\"done\" expr=\"false()\"/>\n  </datamodel>\n  <state id=\"a\">\n    <transition event=\"range\" cond=\"$a1 &gt; 1 &amp;&amp; $a1 &lt; 9 || $a1 == 0\" target=\"b\"/>\n    <transition event=\"first\" cond=\"$count == 1 &amp;&amp; true()\" target=\"b\"/>\n    <transition event=\"loud\" cond=\"$count === 1 AND $a1 !== 2\" target=\"b\"/>\n    <transition event=\"odd\" cond=\"$a1 % 2 = 1 &amp;&amp; !$done\" target=\"b\"/>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"b\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-mixed-habits.scx"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":0,"notes":0,"total":11,"warnings":11},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-mixed-habits.scx"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":10,"byteOffset":283,"endColumn":58,"endLine":8,"startColumn":48,"startLine":8},"insertedContent":{"text":"and"}}]}],"description":{"text":"use `and`"},"properties":{"applicability":"machine-applicable"}}],"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-mixed-habits.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":58,"endLine":8,"startColumn":48,"startLine":8}}}],"message":{"markdown":"xpath syntax error in `cond`: `&&` is not an XPath operator\n\n**Note:** a condition that cannot be parsed raises `error.execution` and evaluates as false, so this condition can never hold\n\n**Help:** XPath spells logical and as `and`\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.9 Expressions\n\n**Spec:** SCXML CR 2014 §C.3 The XPath Data Model","text":"xpath syntax error in `cond`: `&&` is not an XPath operator"},"prope